cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated paper."
type: software
title: "Transformer Loss-of-Life Simulation under Rooftop-PV Penetration"
abstract: >
  Reproducible Python simulation codebase for the IEEE ICT-PEP 2026 paper
  on transformer loss-of-life acceleration under high rooftop-PV penetration
  in Indonesian tropical substations. Implements the IEEE C57.91-2011
  differential thermal model and an XGBoost autoregressive surrogate for
  fast Monte Carlo analysis.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-30"
